#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloning"
msgstr "Clonazione"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reproduce the technology to manufacture an orga shooter yourself."
msgstr ""
"Riproduci la tecnologia per costruire autonomamente un robot tiratore "
"organico."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find some more <a object|bullet>organic matter</a> and, given an appropriate"
" research program performed by your <a object|labo>autolab</a>, <a "
"object|human>you</a> should be able to manufacture orga shooters yourself."
msgstr ""
"Trova altra <a object|bullet>materia organica</a>: dopo un’adeguata ricerca "
"nel <a object|labo>laboratorio automatico</a>, <a object|human>potrai</a> "
"produrre autonomamente i robot tiratori organici."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Produce a <a object|botos>legged orga shooter</a> and bring it back aboard "
"your <a object|base>spaceship</a>."
msgstr ""
"Produci un <a object|botos>robot tiratore organico a zampe</a> e portalo a "
"bordo dell’<a object|base>astronave</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please keep in mind that low energy resources are a major concern on this "
"planet."
msgstr ""
"Ricorda che le scarse risorse energetiche sono un problema importante su "
"questo pianeta."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10 ../help/soluce.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Centaury."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Centaury."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SURFACE<c/>"
msgstr "-> SUPERFICIE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Temperature:      23.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosphere:       oxygen, nitrogen, ammonia\n"
"\\tab;Wind:             1.2 mps\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     some\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      some"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Temperatura:      23.4C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosfera:       ossigeno, azoto, ammoniaca\n"
"\\tab;Vento:             1.2 mps\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     presente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      presente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SUBSOIL<c/>"
msgstr "-> SOTTOSUOLO<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Energy source:    none\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Fonte di energia:    assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<c/>"
msgstr "-> INFORMAZIONI AGGIUNTIVE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Detected:         giant ants\n"
"\\tab;  - Danger:       not immediate\n"
"\\tab;Detected:         reusable derelicts"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Rilevato:         formiche giganti\n"
"\\tab;  - Pericolo:       non immediato\n"
"\\tab;Rilevato:         relitti riutilizzabili"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "Soluzione"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A <a object|botrecy>recycler</a> that will allow you to make your first <a "
"object|titan>titanium cube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Un <a object|botrecy>robot riciclatore</a> che ti permetterà di ottenere il "
"primo <a object|titan>cubo di titanio</a>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A <a object|botgs>legged grabber</a> that is very good at climbing steep "
"slopes."
msgstr ""
"Un <a object|botgs>robot trasportatore a zampe</a>, molto abile nel risalire"
" pendii ripidi."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "A nearly charged <a object|atomic>nuclear power cell</a>."
msgstr "Una <a object|atomic>batteria nucleare</a> quasi carica."

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Power the <a object|botgs>legged grabber</a> with the <a "
"object|atomic>nuclear power cell</a>, and use it to carry a <a "
"object|titan>titanium cube</a> to the <a object|base>spaceship</a>. Choose "
"the direct way over the mountains."
msgstr ""
"Alimenta il <a object|botgs>robot trasportatore a zampe</a> con la <a "
"object|atomic>batteria nucleare</a> e usalo per portare un <a "
"object|titan>cubo di titanio</a> all’<a object|base>astronave</a>. Scegli il"
" percorso diretto sopra le montagne."

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the titanium to build a <a object|convert>converter</a>. Execute the "
"program <code>CollectTitanium3</code> on the <a object|botgs>legged "
"grabber</a> and you will have plenty of titanium."
msgstr ""
"Usa il titanio per costruire un <a object|convert>convertitore</a>. Esegui "
"<code>CollectTitanium3</code> sul <a object|botgs>robot trasportatore a "
"zampe</a> e avrai titanio in abbondanza."

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stop the program, and use the grabber to collect some <a "
"object|uranore>uranium ore</a> in a second small valley to the east. Again, "
"do not take the way of the valley which is crawling with ants, but take the "
"direct way over the mountains."
msgstr ""
"Ferma il programma e usa il robot trasportatore per raccogliere <a "
"object|uranore>minerale di uranio</a> in una seconda valletta a est. Anche "
"stavolta evita la valle infestata dalle formiche e passa direttamente sopra "
"le montagne."

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a <a object|botfj>winged shooter</a> and power it with a <a "
"object|atomic>nuclear power cell</a>. If you take the pass south-east, you "
"will arrive immediately at the ant nest. Kill all the ants, and bring back a"
" ball of <a object|bullet>organic matter</a> to the <a "
"object|base>spaceship</a>."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci un <a object|botfj>robot tiratore volante</a> e alimentalo con "
"una <a object|atomic>batteria nucleare</a>. Il passo a sud-est conduce "
"direttamente al nido. Elimina tutte le formiche e porta una sfera di <a "
"object|bullet>materia organica</a> all’<a object|base>astronave</a>."

#. type: Bullet: '5)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build an <a object|labo>auto-lab</a>, drop the <a object|bullet>organic "
"matter</a> on the platform and click the <button 110/> button in order to "
"develop the blueprints for the orgaShooter cannon."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci un <a object|labo>laboratorio automatico</a>, posa la <a "
"object|bullet>materia organica</a> sulla piattaforma e fai clic sul pulsante"
" <button 110/> per sviluppare i progetti del cannone organico."

#. type: Bullet: '6)'
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a <a object|botos>legged orga shooter</a>, bring it aboard and take "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Costruisci un <a object|botos>robot tiratore organico a zampe</a>, portalo a"
" bordo e decolla."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll find some useful items in a small valley northeast."
msgstr "Troverai alcuni oggetti utili in una valletta a nord-est."
